          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "വൈകാതെ — vaikāte — \"before long\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "വൈകാതെ ആംബുലൻസ് എത്തി. vaikāte āmbulansŭ etti. Before long the ambulance arrived."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The negative form of വൈകുക, to be late: without being late."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "വൈകാതെ (vaikāte) is native Dravidian, the negative participle of വൈകുക (vaikuka), \"to stay, to be late\" (DEDR 5554): without delaying."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
