          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഒടുക്കം (oṭukkaṁ) is native Dravidian: DEDR 954 lists Malayalam oṭukkam, \"the end; finally\", beside ഒടുങ്ങുക, \"to come to an end\". ഒടുവിൽ, \"at last\", comes from the same root."
            }
          ]
