          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഏതാണ്ട് (ētāṇṭŭ) is a native Malayalam adverb whose origin is not settled. It softens a number or a statement: almost, roughly."
            }
